 "structural_change": "q5 FAIL (2 fail): reset_landing (rst_n 4 raw sinks: two face leaves u_rs/u_rs2) and GPL RSZ-3006 (resizer could not buffer native net n1957 with dont_touch loads). q6: (1) RTL r4: one 2-flop face leaf u_rsf + two registered relay copies (rst_n 2 raw sinks; uniform +1 release edge, zero data edges); (2) PRE_GLOBAL_PLACE hook releases dont_touch on native combinational cells (flops stay), so repair can size/buffer the weak native drivers. Same q5 geometry, pins, macros and balanced symmetric spine. qfd_coll_split_q4 FAIL: pin-flop spread q4 100.6/96.7, q4w 86.9/83.7 ps TT/FF and 262 native drivers >32 (legacy fp32 adder). q5: (1) native32 caller (Codex LAT7 FAN32/ADD_FAN32 + QW-ORPHANS reset leaves) census PASS 77257 roots max 32; (2) balanced symmetric clock spine with macro leaves (OT_SPINE SYM/SAFE_BALANCE/MACRO_LEAF) replacing the single Triton tree; (3) same abutted-stack 43.2-lattice geometry and pin faces, synth std 10989 um2. Zero added cycles.",
